{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"X\",\n    \"core\": \"平\",\n    \"concise\": \"平\",\n    \"human\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：X 的大块本身就能交代想靠近、怕成为负担、只敢露出一点喜欢、又舍不得失去亲近的因果链；Y 只看加亮词，容易变成缺少主语和逻辑关系的关键词串。small：X 的感受小字大多是可跳读、能挂回相邻话块的体验补充；Y 有些小字偏向声部和旋律说明，补充重心不总落在人物体验上。core：两版都完整呈现了亲密带来的幸福与害怕它消失的痛楚，主线没有明显偏离；concise：两版都有主句和感受重复表达的情况，例如 S10 的想哭与眼泪、S11 的不再藏着喜欢与不再为它道歉，整体难分高下。human：Y 整体句法更顺；X 有“晃得一下失重”“光安静享受已经不够”“念头刚安静又冒出算了但还是放不下”等具体搭配或省略不自然的问题。fine：X 的感受更多落在观众身体和心里的具体反应，Y 则有不少内容转向描述歌声、声部和音型。load：Y 每屏突出的是较短的关键词组，X 多屏需要扫读三到五个较长的大块，尤其 S14 的五块对短时间扫屏更不友好。整体选 X，主要因为大字独立传递故事的能力和感受补充的定位更符合这次的观看任务，尽管 Y 在自然度和扫读轻松程度上更好。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f7c5b504-877d-414e-8a6a-01a44e750f80", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T044229053119Z", "elapsed_seconds": 282.25, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T04:47:11.314240+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8b86c7166a3d865085d1a97bdf2eec713724a423975a8b23f17beb104d3d2ab6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", 